  if (['AB-PMJAY', 'Vay Vandana (Seniors 70+)', 'MJPJAY (Maharashtra)', 'YSR Aarogyasri (AP)', 'KASP (Kerala)', 'CMCHIS (Tamil Nadu)'].includes(scheme.short_code)) {
